1. Virgin powder is sieved to the desired size range.
2. Powder is used for a build.
3. Leftover powder is sieved again to the original size range.
4. Reused powder is blended with as much virgin powder as is necessary to complete the next build.
5. Steps 2– 4 are repeated until the reused powder has been used X times (where X is the maximum allowable number of reuses).
6. Leftover powder is disposed as waste.
